{
  "key": 9230,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000223_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, stand back and watch this.\r",
        "My Pokémon will clear away\n",
        "a boulder blocking the way...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000223_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Fallen boulders need to be smashed\n",
        "so they're out of the way.\r",
        "Only Pokémon who know these\n",
        "tunnels can do it safely.\r",
        "Now, if you're after the Badge,\n",
        "you'll have to beat the Gym Leader.\r",
        "That'd be me!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000223_00002",
      "en_US": "MACHOP: Maaacho!"
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000223_00003",
      "en_US": "MACHOP: Chopchop!"
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000223_00004",
      "en_US": "MACHOP: Chopmacho!"
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000223_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "I met these MACHOP on Route 207.\r",
        "They’ve now become my most trusted\n",
        "partners!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1SealedTunnel",
      "en_US": [
        "The tunnel's been sealed off\n",
        "with rubble.\r",
        "...From somewhere beyond it,\n",
        "a faint crying."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1RowanAnotherOne",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: I came as soon as the\n",
        "readings spiked.\r",
        "...So. Another one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1GariusGiantHitmonlee",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Was that...\n",
        "a GIANT Hitmonlee?!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1RowanTheShard",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: I've spent every hour since\n",
        "Lake Verity with that shard.\r",
        "It isn't a rock. It's energy.\n",
        "A Pokémon's pain, pressed solid."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1RowanTheMawile",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: The Mawile you fought had\n",
        "a sliver of the same thing in it.\r",
        "That's why it attacked."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1RowanATotem",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: A Pokémon caught on the far\n",
        "side of a rift like this one\f",
        "soaks that energy in until it\f",
        "swells. Huge. Furious. Suffering.\r",
        "...A totem."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1RuthPullItOut",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}: Can't we pull the energy\n",
        "back out?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1RowanNotFromThisSide",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Not from this side.\n",
        "It's bound to that world.\r",
        "Defeat the totem there, in the\n",
        "Distortion World, and the energy\f",
        "should drain out of it.\r",
        "The Pokémon should go free."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1GariusEasy",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: So we go in and beat it!\n",
        "Easy!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1RowanWithoutAGuide",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: You will do nothing of the\n",
        "kind without a guide.\r",
        "That world nearly swallowed\n",
        "you once."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1RowanWhyThisRift",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: And I want to know why this\n",
        "rift is here at all.\r",
        "Rifts don't tear open on\n",
        "their own."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1RuthRoute204",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}: Professor, it's collapsing!\r",
        "...No, wait. The readings didn't\n",
        "drop. They moved.\r",
        "Something just opened up north\n",
        "of Jubilife, near Route 204."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1RowanItsWaiting",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: Then it isn't gone.\n",
        "It's waiting."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1RoarkCrying",
      "en_US": [
        "Roark: My miners have been hearing\n",
        "that crying for a week.\r",
        "Every Pokémon in Oreburgh's\n",
        "been on edge since."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1RoarkVouches",
      "en_US": [
        "Roark: That badge you won means\n",
        "Oreburgh vouches for you.\r",
        "Calm that thing down, and I've\n",
        "got a feeling you'll find out\f",
        "what that's worth."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1RowanOnePerson",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: There's one person who has\n",
        "walked that world and come back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1GariusSpacesuitGuy",
      "en_US": "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Spacesuit guy?"
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1RowanFindHim",
      "en_US": [
        "Rowan: He was seen in Jubilife.\r",
        "Find him. Bring him to me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "OreburghMineB2F_Text_Arc1EndOfArc1",
      "en_US": [
        "END OF ARC 1\n",
        "To be continued..."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
